  "body": "Remove a misleading no-op step, and an inaccurate note, from this algorithm. Instead, replace them with an assert that such a step is unnecessary.\n\nIt's likely that in previous revisions of the specification text (perhaps before moving to HTML), this step did something. But it definitely is unnecessary now.\n\nFixes #11064.\n\n/cc @atscott\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11073/nav-history-apis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 26, 2025, 4:49 AM UTC (70070aa)\">/nav-history-apis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11073/a901b2a...70070aa/nav-history-apis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 26, 2025, 4:49 AM UTC (70070aa)\">diff</a> )",
